title: "Cluchagues-Marcus framework (in silico validation)"
version: "V1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-08"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23242641"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/cluchagues23-rgb/Cluchagues-Marcus-framework"
abstract: "Python code for the in silico Cluchagues-Marcus framework: non-adiabatic Marcus kinetics coupled to a modified Hill-type dose-response equation, synthetic data, trust-region-reflective fitting and Jacobian-based identifiability analysis. All data are synthetic."
keywords:
  - in silico pharmacology
  - Marcus theory
  - parameter identifiability
  - dose-response modelling
